1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Meet Spidey Sense: production coordination for engineering teams using coding agents and Entire Graph.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:21,500
The lead creates a secure browser room, enters their own identity, and receives a private invite link.

3
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:36,500
A teammate joins entirely through the website. Prompts, reasoning, terminal contents, file contents, and secrets are never transmitted.

4
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:46,500
The authenticated roster updates live, and teammates become assignable through stable member identifiers.

5
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:58,500
The plan captures mission outcome, owner, status, target file, and optional source symbol.

6
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:14,500
Graph Space separates confirmed structural relationships from heuristic or incomplete evidence.

7
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:25,500
Partial analysis remains visible, with explicit source inspection and focused test verification paths.

8
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:33,500
Refresh Evidence rebuilds the real, local, no-egress HardCoders graph as the repository changes.

9
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:36,000
Spidey Sense turns evidence, intent, and live presence into one truthful engineering workflow.
